ther random page.</h2><p>Move from the current signal into the wider system: orient, investigate, verify, then act.</p></div><a class="matrix-pathways-map-link" href="investigation-pathways.html">Open full signal map</a></div><div class="matrix-pathways-sequence" aria-label="Investigation sequence"><span>Discover</span><i></i><span>Investigate</span><i></i><span>Verify</span><i></i><span>Act</span></div><div class="matrix-pathway-grid"><a class="matrix-pathway-card" href="start-here.html"><span class="matrix-pathway-number">01</span><span class="matrix-pathway-card-copy"><strong>Orient</strong><small>Understand the mission, evidence boundary and the main doors into the system.</small></span><span class="matrix-pathway-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="matrix-pathway-card" href="daily-command-brief.html"><span class="matrix-pathway-number">02</span><span class="matrix-pathway-card-copy"><strong>Current signal</strong><small>See what changed, why it matters and which investigation lanes need attention.</small></span><span class="matrix-pathway-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="matrix-pathway-card" href="power-atlas.html"><span class="matrix-pathway-number">03</span><span class="matrix-pathway-card-copy"><strong>Map the power</strong><small>Place the signal inside the wider network of people, institutions and consequences.</small></span><span class="matrix-pathway-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="matrix-pathway-card" href="investigation-pathways.html"><span class="matrix-pathway-number">04</span><span class="matrix-pathway-card-copy"><strong>Open the signal map</strong><small>Browse every public route by mission instead of hunting through menus.</small></span><span class="matrix-pathway-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="matrix-pathways-boundary"><strong>Command Deck:</strong> Follow the records, preserve uncertainty and treat association as context rather than proof.</p></section><!-- cinematic-pathways:end